{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Zu90efzimGPFm9vuhyglnw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:19.134528+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Zu90efzimGPFm9vuhyglnw","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><span><span>为进一步提高上海海事大学商船学院研究生生源质量，优化生源结构，促进各高校优秀在校大学生的互动交流，增强学生对上海海事大学商船学院学科发展、研究生培养、导师团队和科研平台的了解，商船学院拟于2026年7月举办优秀大学生夏令营活动，欢迎广大同学踊跃报名。</span></span></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/B8bqPqqrfdwbK31OS4zHE3zVm3bGSg1XLcFkLmzLq79IZ9AMj6InsrckLRDyadCp20iagia1ZvXYkz0vp0K3Zicib5w1tNhllzXFngyCNLYF72w/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>一</span></strong></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/B8bqPqqrfdxaHuv8sH4zMy4DkC1EcB4AiaBkRGE3nuic1w4OSAPP0k0bogRagAE5q8VncmhaUGwnJHS9vPjYfVvQwgsibYfgicCicfox607VicdVo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>活动时间及方式</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section><section><section><p><span>活动时间：2026年7月13日-7月17日（共五天，具体安排以入营通知为准）。</span></p><p><span>活动地点：上海海事大学临港校区（上海市浦东新区海港大道1550号）。</span></p><p><span>活动方式：线下开展。</span></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>二</span></strong></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/B8bqPqqrfdxKRnoqapcYTl6BhxcNEyvQBCX6FzjtZF8WopuM1v82HTShrkQHibWA7tU9X1dIZ0wdsRs3usx2yQryCQzlE9581H5FDcknGVVQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>夏令营活动安排</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><span>主要内容：开营仪式，学院及学位点介绍，研究生招生政策宣讲，导师团队介绍，船舶动力与能效、智能船舶、智能机舱、绿色低碳航运、安全科学与工程等方向专题学术讲座，参观“吴淞”轮、自动化机舱、木兰仿真中心等教学科研平台，在读研究生交流与经验分享，导师分组交流，临港校园文化体验等。</span></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/B8bqPqqrfdzKMibia30hsHsYkqbrqj3XLibsvA8ZCyMZtT3a9tbfceNbbMqdTr9TwjibOztlusUtMMX95UqYY7V8uWhKibSyoicelyMuDQ3P5oFXI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>三</span></strong></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/B8bqPqqrfdywETmAP8qZj7LxpUb7PuF2kgmmx2fGJwyIqbL26sLgeWowODWdHfNrQicg8ibuKwzyDtgdYlIbLQYia5yibgRVBiaxJ5LS8aoorkZQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>申请条件及办法</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>（一）报名条件</span></strong></p><p><span>   1. 品德优良、遵纪守法，身心健康、诚实守信，学风端正，符合硕士研究生招生报考条件；</span></p><p><span>   2. 拟申请到我院攻读研究生的2027届优秀应届本科毕业生；</span></p><p><span>   3. 有意向申报我院2027年推荐免试研究生或报考我院2027年硕士研究生；</span></p><p><span>   4. 英语水平良好，具备一定的英语阅读、写作和交流能力；</span></p><p><span>   5. 学习成绩优秀，预计达到所在高校推荐免试研究生要求者优先；</span></p><p><span>   6. 本科专业与商船学院相关学科方向具有较好匹配度，包括但不限于轮机工程、船舶与海洋工程、能源与动力工程、船舶电子电气工程、航海技术、交通运输、交通工程、自动化、电气工程、人工智能、机械工程、安全工程、海洋工程等相关专业；</span></p><p><span>   7. 对智能船舶、绿色低碳航运、船舶动力与能效、智能机舱、海上交通安全等领域具有浓厚兴趣，具有科研训练、学科竞赛、创新创业项目或相关成果者优先考虑。</span></p><p><strong><span>（二）网上报名时间</span></strong></p><p><span>  即日起至2026年6月24日16:00。</span></p><p><strong><span>（三）报名方式</span></strong></p><p><span> 网上报名地址：https://zhaosheng.eol.cn/10254/user/login/login（上海海事大学夏令营管理系统）。</span></p><p><span>  申请人在上海海事大学夏令营管理系统注册后进行网上报名，请按系统要求如实填写申请信息。</span></p><p><strong><span>（四）报名材料</span></strong></p><p><span>   申请者获得入营资格后，来学校报到时需提交相关纸质版材料，包括：</span></p><p><span>   1. 《上海海事大学优秀大学生夏令营申请表》（获得入营资格后，在报考系统内点击确认入营并下载）；</span></p><p><span>   2. 有效居民身份证正反面复印件和学信网近期下载的《教育部学籍在线验证报告》；</span></p><p><span>   3. 本科成绩单（申请者只需提供前5学期成绩即可）与总评成绩排名证明；</span></p><p><span>   4. 外语水平证明复印件；</span></p><p><span>  5. 其他证明材料复印件（如已发表论文、科研训练项目、学科竞赛获奖、专利、软件著作权、其他获奖或资格证书等）。</span></p><p><span>  特别提醒：报名考生须对所提交材料的真实性负责，若发现存在材料虚假等情况，一经核实，将取消学员资格、优秀学员资格。</span></p><p><span>（五）夏令营招生专</span><span><span>业</span></span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span>类别</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>招生专业</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>学硕</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>动力工程及工程热物理、交通信息工程及控制、载运工具运用工程、轮机工程、安全科学与工程</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>专硕</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>人工智能、船舶工程、动力工程、清洁能源技术、海洋工程、水路交通运输</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/B8bqPqqrfdxJ94DbRjPaOABJluAHickZ0jHDPUACZdzBVnoVtty1jSuyn8Hib4u7YUMPXbrhJNiaRLibicE0BHmySl6Ck7qZLs2Mfx5IFQkG1MLk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>四</span></strong></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/B8bqPqqrfdxjYzBESsPNUguY5CS1pIE4zt01wCWCSzBChiaaqK7oicwhoMxD0Pq1N8PJMtnx1hhXiaQ7oO0Oa4Csiah7KeGBftkk7mWVhYkVNUw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>计划人数</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><span><section><section><section></section><section><section><section><span>     学院计划招募20名左右学员。学院将对申请人资格和申请材料进行审核，审核通过的学员名单拟于6月30日前在商船学院官网公布，并直接通知学员本人（以电话或电子邮件形式）。届时未接到入营通知的同学皆为未入选者，不再另行通知。</span></section></section></section></section></section></span><table><tbody><tr></tr></tbody></table><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>五</span></strong></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/B8bqPqqrfdwlcTYpELfxDZj7E26jaWDwjfz9vul8q5825g3FrlvDTk3rtXS1WKCwgqNliclpicVgZbxmNLAxYOfAEuQybsceA6piaL7mEmKMXo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><strong><span>学校为学员提供以下保障</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section><section><section><span>    1. 夏令营期间统一安排住宿，统一购买夏令营活动期间的团体意外保险；</span><p><span>    2. 对全程参加夏令营活动的学员，按学校和学院相关规定提供生活补贴、伙食补贴；</span></p><p><span>    3. 学校将提供外地学员往返路费补贴，请外地学员保留好交通票据，具体标准以后续通知为准；</span></p><p><span>    4. 学习资料由商船学院统一安排，免费提供。</span></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>六</span></strong></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/B8bqPqqrfdwcXobgjrXuAG3lgrfMiaJXiaMM94m3G3NRPs8nPeaA6jXlDWbiaMcjbtaQicH2ph0CjKYvJgGic7uXoQiaApeADkRpSuD6ApjGeyibP8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>优秀学员评选</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span><span>学校将评选夏令营优秀学员，并给获评学员颁发证书。</span></span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>七</span></strong></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/B8bqPqqrfdwwQjwBZh3WGiadzQLeCFcxKhoXdhmkNWpR4iaFbU7cbP3HU2ibIUMCveOAl2RUJp7ch55taKEYOa2BP41yO8k0PA1SZNSJhpsicv4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>其他注意事项</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span>. </span><span><span>学员须遵守我院相关规定，在营期间服从统一安排和管理；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span>. </span><span><span>本次活动最终解释权归上海海事大学商船学院所有。</span></span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>八</span></strong></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/B8bqPqqrfdzSyxzlVYz2oIlTy410SqdPlH6BZAxksz32oBnmkpPTRQLJ1bbSFQWxsFMB7uUHFKAu7iabGrOwicUjHwtA8HH01IH5lWrX9zL9s/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/B8bqPqqrfdwpfUQs4u61dMWNOZOh2PJ53XsQj9ibQGawje0q3AzwurfNCpeZ7Ltwm2ibwjlyFC678z4ElsqjdoTNpPo9BYAtFMvGHVOLyNKO8/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>联系地址：上海市浦东新区海港大道1550号上海海事大学临港校区商船学院</span></span></p><p><span><span>商船学院联系人： 孙老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>咨询电话： 021-38283386</span></span></p><p><span><span>咨询邮箱：sunang@shmtu.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><span><span>研究生院招生办联系方式：</span></span></p><p><span><span>021-38284585</span></span></p><p><span><span>gs_admission@shmtu.edu.cn</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span><span>上海海事大学商船学院</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2026</span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"eff8c4ceebb7494455516bf151cf7f4b904bd6a3b16248eeec586627eb1cca58","textLength":1753,"sourceSha256":"c103d0e1c7f5c04e1de876ee20072a3e35ad8dd082111d7832c1b76321343b91","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-2e8ea2bce40c85baafa1","title":"2026年上海海事大学商船学院2026年优秀大学生夏令营活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:19.134528+00:00"}
